        "id": 169191,
        "name": "eugeneruss",
        "username": "eugeneruss",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/a183cd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-23T06:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"robb8888\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> robb8888:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;How did Mortal Form to Energy help you? &nbsp;This Scholar can't heal, so he can't do the extra damage from MFtE.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Get Out of the Way did 1 fire damage to both remaining targets (rat and his nest), then healed Scholar for 2 (X, where X is the number of targets dealt damage this way). Mortal Form to Energy x2 let him deal 2 energy damage to 1 target twice (once for each card). All the damages increased quite a bit by the cards in play.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
