        "created_at": "2016-03-24T22:56:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>NightMist for the win!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Got almost knocked out, but went into Mist mode, let the rats chomp on Plague Rat, and came out at the end for a series of heedless lashes and oblivions to finish off the beast.</p>",
