        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-24T23:14:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I played again trying to see if I could take out Plague Rat on round two w/out using the exact script written above. I mucked it up a bit, I guess, because at the end of Scholar's second round Plague Rat had one HP left. I was kinda worried because everyone but Haka was in low single digits at this point ...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But then a rat came out and finished off Plague Rat!</p>",
