        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-28T04:00:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I knew the key to this was going to be all-put damage and I tried for that initially, but some early mistakes cost me the quick victory (including not knowing how to utilize Nightmist properly). Ended up with everyone but Scholar uncapped and a two hour game that I possibly could have won if I’d been paying more attention.</p>\n<p>Second game, quick two-round victory. Damage damage damage.</p>",
